slot1_summary:S193 sharper closure of E3.1 - Connes K^3 dominated by Hiary K^{17/13} on setup; per-query identical (both O(K) explicit-formula sum); Thread 2 reduces to Thread 3
slot2_summary:S194 empirical fluctuation sweeps at x~1e5 (40 samples, K_max=3000) and x~1e6 (40 samples, K_max=8000); hit-rate at K=log^2(x) decays 30%->5% with x, median |error| grows from 1.58 to 4.56; negative-shape evidence that K=polylog(x) does NOT suffice for pi(x)+/-1 in distribution at tested scales
slot3_summary:S195 GUE random-phase heuristic Var(pi(x)-R_K(x)) ~ x log^2(K)/(2pi^2 K log^2 x); validated across 600 triples spanning 3 decades (added x~1e7 sweep, 40 samples K_max=5500); pooled Pearson r=0.62, slope-through-origin ratio 0.74 (=GUE-vs-Poisson reduction); asymptotic K*(x,p)=Theta(x) NOT polylog with constants 0.09x for p=50% and 1.35x for p=99%; closes Thread 3 quantitatively in distribution
slot4_summary:S196 variance decomposition Var(error)=Var(TAIL)(K)+Var(BIAS)(K,h) under iid uniform-phase model with disjoint-j independence; Var(TAIL) is independent of h, forcing K=Theta-tilde(x) regardless of bandwidth; empirical 40 samples x 11 bandwidths x K_max=2000 at x~1.78e5 confirms K*_50 unchanged at 1782-1783 for h<=3e-4 and unreachable within K_max for h>=5e-4; bias variance prediction matches empirical 5-15% across active regime; smoothing strictly does NOT help, optimal h=0; eliminates slot-3 follow-up (b)
slot5_summary:S202 WRAP - unified conditional theorem covering 5 regimes (per-query unsmoothed; amortised; CCM-spectral; in-distribution; log-Gaussian-smoothed) all giving K*(x,p)=Theta-tilde(x) for any positive in-distribution hit-rate p in (0,1); Connes route adds setup K^{22/13} cost over Galway/Hiary with identical per-query cost; no regime breaks the floor; closure conditional on Montgomery pair-correlation random-phase heuristic; legitimate falsifiers (non-Gaussian kernels, x>=10^9, GUE pair correlation, cross-x amortisation) noted as open but not needed for Thread 2 closure
recommended_next_action:All three commit threads (S82, Connes, Galway) now CLOSED. Next commit slot should NOT pick from existing thread list. Recommend frontier_gen mode (auto-fire conditions met: Thread 1 + Thread 2 + Thread 3 all closed; A-grade drought S162-S201 = 40 sessions). Fall-back to A7 plethysm sub-frame (S192 flagged) or D44 BC endomotive Galois-orbit (S163 flagged) as direct A-grade attempts if frontier_gen does not auto-fire.
